<view class="page with-dock"
  ><view class="title">这本书，你想送给谁？</view
  ><view class="subtitle">让爱有迹可循，让时光有处安放。</view
  ><view class="recipients section"
    ><button
      class="recipient {{recipient === '妈妈' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      data-recipient="妈妈"
      bindtap="choose"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/flower-2.svg" /><text
        >送给妈妈</text
      ><text class="small muted">她的温柔，值得被记住</text></button
    ><button
      class="recipient {{recipient === '爸爸' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      data-recipient="爸爸"
      bindtap="choose"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/sprout.svg" /><text>送给爸爸</text
      ><text class="small muted">他的故事，想慢慢听</text></button
    ></view
  ><view class="paper section"
    ><view class="row"
      ><image
        class="purchase-book"
        src="{{bookImage}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
      /><view class="grow"
        ><view class="serif section-title">{{recipient}}的一生</view
        ><view class="subtitle">爱与岁月的故事</view
        ><view class="pill" style="margin-top: 20rpx"
          >一次购买 · 长久珍藏</view
        ></view
      ></view
    ><view class="divider" /><view class="stack"
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/mic.svg" /><text
          >语音讲述，整理人生故事</text
        ></view
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/image.svg" /><text
          >照片与原声，一起留下</text
        ></view
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/book-open.svg" /><text
          >专属故事书，含1本实体书</text
        ></view
      ></view
    ></view
  ><view class="soft section note"
    >这份礼物需要{{recipient}}参与讲述。每次说一小段，慢慢完成；故事经本人确认后再入书。</view
  ><button class="check-row" bindtap="agree"
    ><view class="check-box {{agreed?'on':''}}"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/check-light.svg" /></view
    ><text>我已了解服务内容，并同意服务与隐私说明</text></button
  ><button class="link" bindtap="privacy">查看服务与隐私说明</button
  ><view class="demo-note">前端演示 · 不会产生真实扣款</view></view
><view class="dock row"
  ><view class="grow"
    ><text class="price">¥999</text
    ><view class="small muted">含1本实体书</view></view
  ><button class="btn brown pay-btn" disabled="{{!agreed}}" bindtap="pay"
    >体验购买流程
    <image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-right-light.svg" /></button
></view>
